Record EACH finding as an event via the finding verb (--key <local F1> --severity/--likelihood/--impact --location --reason) — the TOOL assigns the run-unique label L6-F{N} (your lens number 6 is your ROLE, stable across rounds: L1-L4 citation slices, L5 logic/completeness, L6 dark-side/risk — so found_by stays comparable run-wide) and returns it.
